WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.019 --> 00:00:06.499
In Record Entry / Siri, tap the Shortcuts button

2
00:00:06.499 --> 00:00:10.342
Touch and hold Record Entry with the microphone icon

3
00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:16.879
Choose New Shortcut to create a personal shortcut

4
00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:21.774
Tap Edit to open the action editor

5
00:00:21.774 --> 00:00:26.391
Tap Entry and choose Ask Each Time

6
00:00:26.391 --> 00:00:37.294
Open the name menu at the top and choose Rename

7
00:00:37.294 --> 00:00:42.422
Choose a short name, such as “家計簿につけて”

8
00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:47.833
Check the saved name. This video covers setting up the name
